message: "Please cite the research note when discussing the method, and this repository when using the reference implementation."
title: "Shared Structure, Independent Evidence: Alpha-normalised compression distance for refactoring and test design"
type: article
authors:
  - family-names: Seihun
    given-names: Hara Renia
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-24
url: "https://github.com/hara-seihun/alpha-normalised-ncd"
