license: MIT
keywords:
  - normalized compression distance
  - alpha normalisation
  - refactoring
  - test oracles
  - mutation testing
  - code similarity
abstract: >-
  A research note and executable demonstrations of alpha-normalised
  compression distance as an attention signal for structural refactoring
  and implementation-mirroring test oracles. Independent behavioural
  constraints, rather than textual novelty alone, provide test value.
